      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BREE CABANG (4) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Rapidfire Layla (22.95) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from nine starts. Winning claims. LIKE A BLAZE (7) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing seventh (24.98) at Bendigo in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Well placed here and can atone this time. TIPSY TILLY (1) was out of the placings last time when eighth at Bendigo (24.93) but scored five back at Bendigo (24.25). Has a good record here at this journey. Expected to give a good account. MOTIVATE (2) is worth consideration.",
